<!--
    Marvel Super Heroes vs. Street Fighter, English restoration patch (rc1)
    An unofficial fan restoration of Marvel Super Heroes vs. Street Fighter (Japan 970707): the Japanese version's content, in English, in a USA build and a Japanese build.

    Patch by Steve Gordon (https://x.com/strygo).

    This is a patch-overlay MRA: it references the ORIGINAL, unmodified
    MAME romset (mshvsfj.zip) and applies the restoration in memory
    while the game loads. It contains no ROM data. Settings and saves use
    the name 'mshvsfru'.

    Base MRA and jtcps2 core by Jose Tejada (jotego); see his header below.
    Not affiliated with or endorsed by Capcom. Free patch; do not sell.
-->
